function deviceTable(rows){return table(['Operating point','Instance / part','I rms / device [A]','Mapped I rms [A]','Conduction','Body','On','Off','Recovery','ESR / Cu','Core','Total [W]','T [°C]'],orderedOperatingPoints(rows).flatMap(r=>r.devices.map(d=>`<tr><td>${esc(operatingPointLabel(r))}</td><td>${esc(d.instanceName)}<br><span class="caption">${esc(d.part)}</span></td>${d.valid?`<td class="num">${num(d.Irms)}</td><td class="num">${num(d.IrmsTotalMapped)}</td>${CATEGORIES.map(k=>`<td class="num">${num(d.categories[k],4)}</td>`).join('')}<td class="num">${num(d.total,4)}</td><td class="num">${num(d.temperature,3)}</td>`:`<td colspan="11" style="color:var(--red)">${esc(d.error)}</td>`}</tr>`)));}
